<title>CHILE: Chile December wholesale prices fall 0.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Chile December wholesale prices fall 0.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean wholesale prices fell 0.4 percent in December, bringing the rise in prices for all of 1996 to 3.1 percent, the National Statistics Institute said.</p>
<p>Domestic product prices fell 0.7 percent in December, while imported good prices rose 0.3 percent.</p>
<p>Wholesale prices fell 0.1 percent in December 1995 but rose 8.2 percent in that year as a whole.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago Newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
